  <description>
    <p>Carver is a local-first note-taking app that stays out of your way. Quick to open and ready to catch an idea, it keeps your notes and images on your own computer.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Write in rich text or Carve source, with a live preview and a distraction-free focus view.</li>
      <li>Organize notes into categories, search your library, and recover deleted notes from Trash.</li>
      <li>Give notes structure with frontmatter properties, and build saved views called Bases with configurable columns, filters, and sort rules.</li>
      <li>Import Carve or Markdown, and export to Carve, Markdown, PDF, or a portable archive.</li>
      <li>Optionally connect an assistant such as Claude Code, Codex, Copilot, or OpenCode through local, read-only MCP access.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
